      "sidebarText": "<h3 class=\"title\"><img alt=\"Sidebar - Related Creatures\" title=\"Sidebar - Related Creatures\" style=\"height:20px; padding:2px 10px 0px 2px\" src=\"Images\\Icons\\Sidebar_4_RelatedCreatures.png\"> Spectral Thralls</h3>Specters often keep a few humanoid thralls to torment, preventing the agony of pain starvation, but since they can&apos;t minimize the negative damage they inflict with their vile touch, humanoid thralls who are too low level generally don&apos;t last long.",
